# Only these files are stowed into ~/.config; everything else apps write
# there now lives natively outside this repo. Deny everything by default
# and only allow the specific files worth versioning, as a backstop in
# case something ever gets created directly in this directory again.
*

!.gitignore

!gh/
!gh/config.yml

!ghostty/
!ghostty/config/
!ghostty/config/config

!karabiner/
!karabiner/karabiner.json

!kitty/
!kitty/**

!starship.toml
